{{ tffile "examples/resources/redirect/main.tf" }}

{{ .SchemaMarkdown | trimspace }}

## Import

Redirects can be imported using their ID:

```shell
terraform import dokploy_redirect.example abc123-redirect-id
```

Or using import blocks (Terraform 1.5+):

```hcl
import {
  to = dokploy_redirect.example
  id = "abc123-redirect-id"
}
```
